[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3064957922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108524#issuecomment-3064957922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108524","id":3064957922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62r4vi","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T08:52:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T08:52:15Z","body":"The solution here would be to change the default bind for this action, as it not working when the 3D view is focused is by design","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3064957922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065017195","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108524#issuecomment-3065017195","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108524","id":3065017195,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62sHNr","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T09:56:19Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T09:56:51Z","body":"I don’t think we should change the default bind of pausing the animation? \nThe initial design was that we could control the animation whatever the mouse position was, and whatever the node being selected in the outliner was, using A, S and D, as long as the animation tab is visible. These shortcuts are consistent with Godot-style shortcuts where useful shortcuts are placed on a row of keys accessible by the left hand.\n\nHowever, the question is that now that we added S for Scaling, which one takes priority when the animation is playing and a node3d is selected?\n\nI would suggest that if the animation is playing and the animation player is on screen, S pauses the animation. If the animation is already paused S would either scale the node3d or do nothing as long as the animation tab is visible.\n\nPersonally, I think the blender-style shortcuts should not be activated by default as they are often incompatible with Godot-style shortcuts. If we want to support Blender-style shortcuts without battling with key conflicts, we could consider providing two separate key mappings: \n- one designed around the Blender-style shortcuts, and\n- one designed around the Godot-style shortcuts. \n\nIn the later, the immediate scaling operation could be bound to pressing R twice for instance, as R is the scale tool shortcut. But this is a discussion for another proposal 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065017195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065021179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108524#issuecomment-3065021179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108524","id":3065021179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62sIL7","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-12T10:01:42Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T10:01:42Z","body":"The editor uses focus and I don't think the animation dock should have priority here, but it's something to discuss more in detail","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3065021179/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117122589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108524#issuecomment-3117122589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108524","id":3117122589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65y4Qd","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T09:49:31Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T09:49:31Z","body":"Can someone confirm that S is assigned to `Begin Scale Transformation` by default? I have t